  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "CREDITS\n\n\nDeveloped By\nOlivia Renz\n\nExecutive Producer\nOlivia Renz\n\nGame
    Director\nOlivia Renz\n\nCreative Director\nOlivia Renz\n\nLead Programmer\nOlivia
    Renz\n\nProgrammers\nOlivia Renz\n\nGameplay Programmer\nOlivia Renz\n\nTechnical
    Director\nOlivia Renz\n\nLead Designer\nOlivia Renz\n\nGame Designer\nOlivia
    Renz\n\nLevel Designer\nOlivia Renz\n\nNarrative Designer\nOlivia Renz\n\nWriter\nOlivia
    Renz\n\nStory Editor\nOlivia Renz\n\nDialogue Writer\nOlivia Renz\n\nVFX Artist\nOlivia
    Renz\n\nUI/UX Designer\nOlivia Renz\n\nSound Designer\nOlivia Renz\n\nVoice Acting\nOlivia
    Renz\n\nQuality Assurance\nOlivia Renz\n\nBug Tester\nOlivia Renz\n\nProfessional
    Bug Creator\nOlivia Renz\n\nBug Fixer\nOlivia Renz\n\nPlaytester\nOlivia Renz\n\nLegal
    Department\nOlivia Renz\n\nAccounting\nOlivia Renz\n\nHuman Resources\nOlivia
    Renz\n\nIT Support\nOlivia Renz\n\nOffice Management\nOlivia Renz\n\nSnack Procurement\nOlivia
    Renz\n\nCaffeine Department\nOlivia Renz\n\nEmotional Support\nOlivia Renz\n\nSomeone
    Who Knows\nWhat She's Doing\nOlivia Renz\n\nSomeone Who Definitely\nKnows What
    She's Doing\nOlivia Renz\n\nSomeone Who Should Have\nKnown What She Was Doing\nOlivia
    Renz\n\nSomeone Who Doesn't Know\nWhat She's Doing\nOlivia Renz\n\nEntire Development
    Team\nOlivia Renz\n\n\n\nSPECIAL THANKS\n\n\nKasane Teto\nSpecial appearance.\n\nHatsune
    Miku\nSpecial appearance.\n\nElysia from AI2U\nSpecial appearance.\n\n\n\nAnd,
    of course:\n\nOlivia Renz\nSpecial appearance in\napproximately every department.\n\n\n\nOUTRO\n\n\nOutro
    Song:\n\u201CClose to You\u201D - Carpenters\n\nThank you for playing.\nYou have
    reached the end of the credits.\nThere is no one else to blame.\n\nOlivia Renz."
